#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state.md:7
msgid "Observation and state"
msgstr "観測と状態"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state.md:9
msgid ""
"CallbackManager emits events at execution boundaries so external code can"
" observe progress and results. Stage is the compatibility boundary that "
"passes existing generation processing and `OptimizationState`; it differs"
" from the state boundary of a graph-native component. `OptimizationState`"
" holds execution values and the values needed for resumption, while "
"`Population` manages population data such as individuals, objectives, and"
" constraints."
msgstr ""
"CallbackManagerは実行境界でイベントを発行し、外部コードが進行状況と結果を観測できるようにします。Stageは既存の世代処理と`OptimizationState`を受け渡す互換性境界であり"
"、graph-"
"nativeコンポーネントの状態境界とは異なります。`OptimizationState`は実行値と再開に必要な値を保持し、`Population`は個体、目的値、制約値などの個体群データを管理します。"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state.md:17
msgid "CallbackManager"
msgstr "{fa}`eye;sd-mr-1` CallbackManager"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state.md:20
msgid "Record events and observe processing during execution."
msgstr "イベントを記録し、実行中の処理を観測します。"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state.md:23
msgid "Feedback"
msgstr "{fa}`comment-dots;sd-mr-1` フィードバック"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state.md:26
msgid ""
"Match candidates to observations and pass them in a form the Algorithm "
"can use."
msgstr "候補と観測を対応付け、アルゴリズムが利用できる形へ渡します。"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state.md:29
msgid "Stage"
msgstr "{fa}`bars-staggered;sd-mr-1` Stage"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state.md:32
msgid "A compatibility execution unit for composing generation processing."
msgstr "世代処理を構成する互換用の実行単位です。"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state.md:35
msgid "OptimizationState"
msgstr "{fa}`hard-drive;sd-mr-1` OptimizationState"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state.md:38
msgid "Holds execution state, results, and values needed for checkpoints."
msgstr "実行状態、結果、チェックポイントに必要な値を保持します。"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state.md:41
msgid "Population"
msgstr "{fa}`users;sd-mr-1` Population"

#: ../../concepts/observation_and_state.md:44
msgid "Manages individuals and evaluation results as a Population and Archive."
msgstr "個体と評価結果を集団およびArchiveとして管理します。"
